---
import Container from "../components/shared/Container.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="关于这座个人知识花园喵~">
  <section class="page-section">
    <Container>
      <article class="page-header">
        <p
          class="page-kicker text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.22em] text-indigo-700 uppercase dark:text-indigo-300"
        >
          About
        </p>
        <h1
          class="page-title mt-5 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-stone-950 sm:text-6xl dark:text-stone-50"
        >
          关于这座知识花园
        </h1>
        <div
          class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600 sm:text-lg dark:text-stone-400"
        >
          <p>这是一个以数学与计算机知识为核心，结合项目实践与学习思考的个人数字花园喵~</p>
          <p>它不会按考试科目切割知识，也不会让有价值的笔记被时间线淹没喵~</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
